  <datafield tag="520" ind1="8" ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Alex Katz is one of the most important and respected living American artists. His paintings are defined by their flatness of colour and form, their economy of line, and their cool but seductive emotional detachment. This catalogue emphasises key themes Katz has returned to throughout his career.</subfield>
  </datafield>
